<p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">{{#if firstName}}Hola {{firstName}},{{else}}Hola,{{/if}}</p>
<h2 style="color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">No se pudo finalizar la sesión</h2>
<p style="color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">El CSMS intentó {{attempts}} veces finalizar esta sesión de carga sin éxito. La sesión ahora está en estado de fallo con el motivo de detención EndRequestFailed. No se cobró ningún importe y se canceló cualquier retención de pago.</p>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin-bottom:24px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">ID de sesión</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{sessionId}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Estación</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{stationId}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if siteName}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Sitio</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{siteName}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if transactionId}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">ID de transacción</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{transactionId}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if endRequestReason}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Motivo de la solicitud de finalización</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{endRequestReason}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if startedAt}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Inicio</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{startedAt}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if endedAt}}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">Fin</td>
    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">{{endedAt}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>
<p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">Revise la sesión en el CSMS y cobre al conductor manualmente si la carga debe pagarse.</p>
